      <title>0.1.56</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in 0.1.56</h3><ul><li>The language chooser in Options is now an on-brand popover instead of the plain system menu, with a live hover highlight and a clear checkmark on the active language.</li>
<li>System default now reliably follows your macOS language when AwakeMate ships it (matching e.g. de-DE to German), and falls back to English when it doesn&apos;t - applied instantly, no relaunch.</li></ul>]]></description>
